B.H5=new A.cx("Early Blight","Alternaria solani","Early blight is a common fungal disease forming dark target-like concentric ring spots on tomato leaves, progressing from bottom foliage upward. It thrives in humid summer climates.",B.N8,B.MA,B.O7,B.NQ,B.O5,u.L,"Check lower leaves weekly for brown target circles. Heavy mulching at planting is the best barrier against early blight.",null)
