B.H7=new A.cx("Late Blight","Phytophthora infestans","Late blight is a highly destructive oomycete disease that collapses tomato leaves, blackens stems, and rots fruit in cool, wet summer weather. It can destroy whole fields in days.",B.Om,B.LL,B.MM,B.MR,B.Os,"Irreversible once stem rot establishes.","Inspect fields daily during cool, rainy summer spells. Early destruction of infected vines is crucial to save the rest of the patch.",null)
